  "checks": [
    "Independent LibreDWG discovery and physical field/frame/CRC walks bind all 32 distinct child sources in both R13 and R14, including corrupted counted-length refusal and original retry for each record.",
    "The adapter accepts generated 32-child controls, rejects first/last child source mutation, alias and oversized graph mutations with preserved destinations, and retries the same adapter. Prior two-child control remains accepted.",
    "The opt-in libdxfrw_AC1012_layout_aggregate_limit CTest rejects the distinct 33-child split source without changing ASCII/binary destinations, then imports and accepts the 32-child split on the same adapter. Producer and LibreDWG verify the two independent source counts.",
    "Scratch-only guard-bypassed staged dictionary, target-role and final-child XRECORD mismatches preserve destinations and permit corrected same-adapter retry for R13 and R14. Independent ezdxf 1.4.5 validates the resulting 12 ASCII/binary 32-child graphs and both split-graph outputs with zero audit errors or fixes.",
    "Six focused fast CTests and the aggregate-limit CTest pass. The pinned generator exactly reproduces both 32-child sources and the R13 split and over-limit sources."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The selected XRECORD payload is ASCII group 1 followed by group 70, with no child EED, reactor, extension or object references. Hard-owner source profiles, larger graphs and other payloads remain refused.",
